answers.approach:
Hush, little brand, one prompt can never be your score;
Sample needs and paraphrases at every model’s door.

Save answers, claims, and citations, dated through the night;
Track share, tone, and volatility—don’t call a snapshot right.

Stage owned-fact and earned-source tests; let matched topics wait;
Then watch for lift in names and visits, though the signal may come late.

Black boxes shift; citations aren’t the causes they may seem;
We’ll map the bounds, not promise we can steer the dream.
